# Real characters and the workbooks they were converted from. These belong to
# the players, not the repository: the app ships with an empty roster and each
# visitor adds their own (kept in their browser only). The test suites read
# their fixtures from here when it is present and skip those checks when it is
# not.
private/

# GM module: campaign state and rules references stay out of the repository
# (player privacy + the engine ships content-free). The tooling under
# gm-module/tools and gm-module/screen is content-free and may be committed
# later if desired.
gm-module/campaigns/
gm-module/rules/
gm-module/secret-rolls.log

# Editor and OS noise
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
node_modules/
